-- many.grant -- a sentence of grants_v32.haro: four rights asked for, every one granted; the sentence stands and the pattern warns (line 8).

DEFINE ZONE ops AS (
  RIGHTS [read, write, share, audit]
) RATIONALE "The operations zone grants four rights"

DEFINE USE report AS (
  WANTS [read, write, share, audit]
) RATIONALE "A report that asks for everything"
